    <article>
  
  

    
  <div>

    
    
  
<div  class="maryland-action-group">
  
  <h2 class="maryland-action-group__title "><span>Get outside!</span>
</h2>
  

  

  <ul  class="maryland-action-group__list">
      
<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Biking and hiking</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Use this interactive map for your next outdoor adventure. Find road and all-terrain bike trails, hiking routes, and more.</div>
      
      <a href="https://geodata.md.gov/recreationatlas/" class="maryland-action-item__link">Explore the recreation map</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Parks and recreation</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">On foot, on wheels or up and over waves, there are many ways to explore Maryland. Check out some of the best places to go and things to do.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/things-to-do/golfing-hiking-biking-recreation" class="maryland-action-item__link">Enjoy outdoor public spaces</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Campgrounds and picnics</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Browse state park and forest camping options. From rustic sites to full service cabins, there&#039;s something for everyone.</div>
      
      <a href="https://dnr.maryland.gov/Publiclands/Pages/campinginfo.aspx" class="maryland-action-item__link">Read more and make a reservation</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Beaches and waterways</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Find a place to swim, hike, or camp by the water. Enjoy scenic towns, go fishing, and look for native wildlife.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/article/explore-marylands-beaches-and-waterways" class="maryland-action-item__link">Discover Maryland’s waterways</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>MD Park Passport</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Get unlimited day-access and boat launching at over 50 state parks. Passes are valid for a full year from the time of purchase.</div>
      
      <a href="https://dnr.maryland.gov/publiclands/pages/annualpass.aspx" class="maryland-action-item__link">Buy your new state park passport</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Land conservation</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Maryland is a leader in land conservation. Read about programs that protect nature and create places for all to enjoy.</div>
      
      <a href="https://dnr.maryland.gov/land/Pages/default.aspx" class="maryland-action-item__link">See the latest projects</a>
  
</li>

  </ul>
</div>



      <hr class="maryland-divider" />
  
  
<div  class="maryland-action-group">
  
  <h2 class="maryland-action-group__title "><span>Uniquely Maryland</span>
</h2>
  

  

  <ul  class="maryland-action-group__list">
      
<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Historic sites</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Maryland&#039;s history is as diverse as the ways to explore it. Visit museums, historic sites, or trace your own family roots.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/history" class="maryland-action-item__link">Discover Maryland&#039;s historic sites</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Arts and culture</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">See what makes arts and culture in our state so rich. From local art festivals to renowned performances, there&#039;s so much to see and do in Maryland.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/things-to-do/maryland-arts" class="maryland-action-item__link">Check out the art scene </a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Family fun</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Explore classic family fun activities as well as things families can only do in our state.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/things-to-do/family-fun" class="maryland-action-item__link">Start planning your family trip</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Seasonal activities</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">From hot days at the beach to wild winter adventures, Maryland has four seasons of fun. Come to celebrate or to settle down, any time of the year.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/getaways/seasonal-travel" class="maryland-action-item__link">Find activities for every season</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Unique experiences</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Find a wide array of activities that you won&#039;t find anywhere else. Come see what makes our state one of a kind.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/unique-experiences/only-in-maryland" class="maryland-action-item__link">Get to know Maryland</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Cruises</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">Start your next cruise from Baltimore. Find the information you need for an unforgettable trip.</div>
      
      <a href="https://cruise.maryland.gov/Pages/default.aspx" class="maryland-action-item__link">Plan your cruise</a>
  
</li>

<li  class="maryland-action-item">
  
  <h3 class="maryland-action-item__heading"><span>Upcoming events</span>
</h3>
  
  
  
            <div class="maryland-action-item__description">There&#039;s always something going on in Maryland. Use this calendar to find sporting events, concerts, festivals, and more.</div>
      
      <a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/events-calendar" class="maryland-action-item__link">Search for an event near you</a>
  
</li>

  </ul>
</div>



  


          <hr class="maryland-divider">

                              
      <section class="maryland-action-resources" aria-labelledby="actions--resources">
        <h2 class="maryland-action-resources__title" id="actions--resources">Keep learning</h2>

        
                <div class="maryland-action-resources__groups">

                    <div class="maryland-action-resources__group">
            <h3 class="maryland-action-resources__group-title">
              Related resources
            </h3>
            <ul class="usa-list">
              
  <li ><a href="/services/recreational-permits-and-licenses" hreflang="en">Recreational Permits and Licenses</a></li>

            </ul>
          </div>
          
                    <div class="maryland-action-resources__group">
            <h3 class="maryland-action-resources__group-title">
              Related agencies
            </h3>
            <ul class="usa-list">
              
  <li ><a href="https://dnr.maryland.gov/publiclands/Pages/default.aspx">Maryland Department of Natural Resources - Park Service</a></li>
  <li ><a href="https://www.visitmaryland.org/">Maryland Office of Tourism</a></li>

            </ul>
